// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3739074990" "You eliminated Byron Wade, landing a telling strike against Octavian's Syndicate forces."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3251085492" "Word is moving fast. Wade has been taken out by an unknown Powers Division member working for the Resistance. My phone has been buzzing like crazy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - JonesDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1301609965" "Ah, {HeroName}. McKnight told me about you over the phone. That was quite a piece of work you did for us, taking down Wade like that. I'm sure Octavian is still reeling from that."
// Answer Text :
"P630839461" "What can I do for you, Mr. Jones?"
// Answer Text :
"P129133293" "I accept your praise, but that is not why I am here."
// Answer Text :
"P2164312541" "Wade was a thorn in our side as well, I was inclined to remove him."
// Page BusinessPage1 Text :
"P3796584808" "Straight to business, huh? I can appreciate that.<br><br>You're a great boon in these trying times, {HeroName}. A surprise asset during this struggle and I wish to utilize you as often and as quickly as I can to maintain momentum toward victory."
// Answer Text :
"P658631895" "I am at your disposal."
// Page BusinessPage2 Text :
"P562580747" "McKnight came to me after his boss, Tatsuri, and most of the forces under his control, were destroyed by Masamoto.<br><br>I knew Tatsuri well, he was a dear friend. I promised McKnight that I would help him avenge Tatsuri's death if he joined us. That promise has been, until now, a lie.<br><br>You, {HeroName}, are the instrument by which my honor bound oath to McKnight will be fulfilled."
// Answer Text :
"P717181939" "I see."
// Page BusinessPage3 Text :
"P1256186274" "Masamoto is strong, but he is not invincible. <color orange>I want you to attack one of his chemical labs.</color><br><br> You are worth a dozen or more of my go-gangers or adepts, so by the time they realize how large of a threat you are it will be too late.<br><br>Eliminate everyone in the lab and then leave. Our objective here is to cripple Masamoto's manpower, not destroy his infrastructure. That is still of use to the true Syndicate."
// Answer Text :
"P1872238067" "It shall be done."
// Page HonorPage1 Text :
"P65475750" "You are humble. That is good. That is excellent.<br><br>Tell me, why are you here?"
// Answer Text :
"P4248281305" "Our goals are aligned. To not cooperate would be foolish."
// Page HonorPage2 Text :
"P1966114012" "You are wise as well. That also is good.<br><br>I made an oath to McKnight to avenge his fallen master. Until now I have been incapable of fulfilling that oath. Will you aid me in restoring my own honor and that of McKnight?"
// Answer Text :
"P3745399971" "I will."
// Answer Text :
"P2096296336" "What of Masamoto?"
// Page MasamotoPage1 Text :
"P1191844684" "Masamoto's fate will come in time, {HeroName}. I appreciate your enthusiasm, but I have other oaths to uphold as well as that which I made to McKnight.<br><br>Patience will see us rewarded."
// Answer Text :
"P2531656418" "I understand."
// Page ResistancePage1 Text :
"P706668858" "You have initiative. That is good. But be careful, {HeroName}. The Syndicate has structure. Work within it and you will thrive. Thrash against it and you will be put down."
// Answer Text :
"P4056647066" "I understand, how can I be of service?"
// Page ResistancePage2 Text :
"P22119572" "I require your assistance in eliminating one of our mutual rivals."
// Answer Text :
"P3217512697" "Octavian?"
// Page ResistancePage3 Text :
"P750597750" "Not Octavian, yet. No, the man I need you to help me with is Masamoto.<br><br>Masamoto is strong, but he is not invincible. <color orange>I want you to attack one of his chemical labs.</color><br><br> You are worth a dozen or more of my go-gangers or adepts, so by the time they realize how large of a threat you are it will be too late.<br><br>Eliminate everyone in the lab and then leave. Our objective here is to cripple Masamoto's manpower, not destroy his infrastructure. That is still of use to the true Syndicate."
// Answer Text :
"P1630795615" "No problem."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1969489644" "I told my boss, Richard Jones, that I know who is responsible for that strike, and he wants to meet you.<br><br><color orange>Talk to Jones and do whatever he asks, even if he orders you to kill me. He's simply testing your loyalty.</color><br><br>Remember that, loyalty and honor are a big deal for the Syndicate, or at least, were. That's partly what this whole schism in their oraganization is about, honor."
// AcceptString :
"P1667684200" "Talk to Richard Jones."
// SendOffString :
"P3913852278" "Jones is high up in the Syndicate, as high up as I could make contact at any rate. I have no clue how far from the top he actually is, but trying to find information about anyone above him is like shining a light into a black hole. There's just nothing.<br><br><color orange>Remember, {HeroName}, you're acting as a Resistance sympathizer in Powers Division. Act the part or we'll both end up like Noble.</color><br><br><color yellow>James Noble</color> went deep undercover into the Resistance. He was easily the best cop on the force, but all his training, skill, and let's face it, luck, didn't matter a lick. Word has it he slipped up with their lingo, totally gave himself away. They never found his body."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2145501966" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: The Chain of Command</color>"

