// Variable - BOSS_75HEALTH_Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P769085574" "Was it Tang?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3300921475" "It was Octavian, wasn't it! That traitorous dog!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_25HEALTH_Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1764797394" "Octavian... he... he's going... to win."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DEAD_Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1470158504" "<em victory>None can oppose Masamoto's might!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4040480753" "You eliminated all the Syndicate personnel in one of Masamoto's labs. That should put a significant dent in his man-power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2261026971" "Jones wants to talk to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3115822454" "Superb work. Anderson was eliminated, Masamoto's forces are crippled, and his operation in shambles.<br><br>McKnight will soon have his vengeance against Masamoto and the true Syndicate will be poised to strike down Octavian and restore order and honor to those who remained loyal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4272182165" "Jones called me and let me know that his first impression of you was good. Buzz in the Syndicate ranks say that Masamoto was delivered a crippling blow. I assume that was what Jones had you doing.<br><br>Just a heads up, Jones mentioned that I'll soon get my chance at vengeance against Masamoto. I'm not sure if he mentioned it, but Jones brought in most of Tatsuri's men after we were made <i>road ronin</i> by Tatsuri's untimely assassination. It's part of what sparked this whole war in the first place.<br><br>I have a feeling I'm going to get tapped by Jones to lead a direct attack on Masamoto himself, you're likely to get called in on that as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TangDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3514462294" "..."
// Answer Text :
"P1956588536" "How can I serve you, Mr. Tang?"
// Answer Text :
"P3926572925" "I have done as you said, Mr. Tang."
// Page Path1Page1 Text :
"P3573429941" "Vengeance, and justice, {HeroName}.<br><br>A very wise man once asked me if I knew the difference between them?<br><br>I thought I did, but his wisdom was profound. Shall I tell you what he told me?"
// Answer Text :
"P266767004" "If it pleases you, Mr. Tang.""
// Page Path1Page2 Text :
"P4067407532" "Justice is given, vengeance is earned.<br><br>Some people are worthy of neither, but only the most exceptional individuals are worthy of both.<br><br>Do you understand this?"
// Answer Text :
"P3082650951" "I believe so, Mr. Tang."
// Page Path1Page3 Text :
"P2586776299" "Good.<br><br>There is a dog in the next room. To your eyes he may appear to be a man, but in your heart you will see him as an animal. I say this because he is the honorless dog that betrayed and killed Tatsuri."
// Answer Text :
"P2107787831" "What do you wish me to do?"
// Page Path1Page4 Text :
"P1285986018" "Show him vengeance, show him justice, and then show him the most powerful act of all... mercy."
// Answer Text :
"P2303058535" "As you wish."
// Page Path2Page1 Text :
"P3291031684" "Do you know why I had you show Masamoto mercy, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1826796179" "I admit, I am unsure."
// Page Path2Page2 Text :
"P1802128151" "I was once shown mercy when I was deserving of only vengeance.<br><br>My master made sure that I would remember well his lesson of mercy, and so he took my eye.<br><br>But he gave me so much more in return."
// Answer Text :
"P196446992" "Mr. Tang?"
// Page Path2Page3 Text :
"P3666838047" "My master's profound insight unlocked within me my true potential. His act of mercy indebted me to his most righteous path and I have served him since that day.<br><br>When it came time for him to exact justice against those who wished him dead, he gave them one last chance to avert their doom, just as he had me. Thus was born the Syndicate<br><br>Those that refused... They were not deserving of mercy."
// Answer Text :
"P3554591393" "Why are you telling me this, Mr. Tang?"
// Page Path2Page4 Text :
"P2739763218" "This war is barbaric. Some believe we have lost our way by joining forces with the Resistance. But the decision was not their choice to make.<br><br>It is my duty to bring order back to the Syndicate. To do that, I must fight from the moral high ground of honor and compassion. We must show our enemies mercy, and hope that justice can be served without the dirty business of vengeance."
// Answer Text :
"P1896870044" "You are indeed a wise man."
// Page Path2Page5 Text :
"P949850326" "My wisdom is not as profound as my Master's, but his lessons have not gone unheard. The true threat to the Syndicate is not the Resistance or the emperor, it is the blind selfishness that festers in the heart of men like Octavian.<br><br>We have no choice but to prune the bansai of its rotten leaves and what remains shall once more be pure.<br><br>Octavian must die, so that the Syndicate may live."
// Page Path2Page6 Text :
"P4163879278" "Report back to Richard Jones. Inform him that Masamoto has confirmed that Octavian shall receive no mercy for what he has done."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P113399335" "Just got a call from Jones. Masamoto just started an attack on Octavian's forces. Looks like he thinks Octavian betrayed him. <color orange>Jones told me to get the remnants of Tatsuri's men ready, we're going in to attack Masamoto now.</color><br><br>We're going in with some heavy firepower. Other than Masamoto, Jones wants no survivors."
// AcceptString :
"P925558880" "Attack Masamoto"
// SendOffString :
"P3497136480" "{HeroName}, keep an eye out. There's more going on here than we know. <color orange>Jones wants Masamoto's forces decimated, but he specifically wants us to take Masamoto alive.</color>I protested this course of action, but he assured me that Masamoto's blood would be on my hands soon enough.<br><br>The only reason I could see for this course of action is that Masamoto knows something of critical importance and they need him to talk. The Syndicate leadership sits in a deep shadow, {HeroName}, and I can't see who is pulling the strings. I think there is more to this war than just a difference of opinion over whether or not to ally with the Resistance. Something big is going on."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4012290493" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: It's Raining Lead</color>"

