// Dialog :
"P1859899619" "Excellent work in taking apart Masamoto's organization. What's left of his men and women are scattered to the wind as road ronin and they'll have a hard time finding any place to belong between Octavian and us.<br><br>My boss wishes to meet you. They've requested your presence while Masamoto is questioned."

