// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P598548695" "You met with Tub Ci Tang, Mr. Richard Jones' boss. You are now one step removed from the head of the Syndicate, but the shadows still conceal his identity."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1282674846" "Report back to Jones"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1967309584" "Jones has been asking if I've heard from you since you talked to his boss. Report to him, then come see me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1759710259" "What did Master Tang have to say?<br><br>Hmmm, I see. So, we are to show Masamoto's men mercy while Octavian shall not be spared.<br><br> I want you to talk to McKnight and inform him that he and his men will need to spread the word to Masamoto's men that they will be welcomed back into the fold."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4085818356" "You've received a chain gun."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4193782065" "What did you learn? Who is Jones' boss?<br><br>Tub Ci Tang? But that man has been dead for years!<br><br>{HeroName}, we're moving into very dangerous waters here. Octavian is the only obstacle that remains keeping the Syndicate divided. If we are to destroy this beast then we will have to find out who the leader of the Syndicate is and eliminate him, Tub Ci Tang, and Octavian all within a very small window of time. Once the Syndicate has been reconstituted I'm afraid that the leader of the Syndicate may fade back into the shadows once more.<br><br>I'll have the Ministry dig up everything they can on Tub Ci Tang and see if we can find out how we didn't know he's been alive these past ten years."
// RandomFameString :
"P1169197902" "Aureas is turning into a warzone. The Syndicate is shooting up everything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2347563003" "{HeroName}, what's up?"
// Answer Text :
"P3506920148" "Is everything alright?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2323935277" "Yeah, we're just engaging Octavian's forces down here. What have you got for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3649423933" "(Explain the situation)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P798811771" "So you've got Octavian on the ropes, huh? Nice, that should pull a lot of the pressure off of us down here.<br><br>Ever since we got involved in this stupid war we've been hit daily by Octavian or Masamoto's hit teams.<br><br>Listen, if you can finish Octavian off now, you do it. Once he's out of the picture we can focus on finding <i>Yin's daughter</i> and then he'll join us against the real threat to Praetoria; Tyrant."
// Answer Text :
"P3285822417" "Wait... Mr. Yin?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2632941656" "Yeah, head of the Syndicate... Who did you think it was, Praetor Sinclair?<br><br>We're pretty sure Octavian's got Yin's daughter. Seeing the opportunity to eliminate one enemy and gain one ally, I offered the support of the Resistance to his little war."
// Answer Text :
"P1520216388" "So if I eliminate Octavian and find Yin's daughter he'll join us?"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P1845909475" "That's the idea. Oh, and just in case Mr. Yin feels like backing out on our agreement, go ahead and force the issue by informing the PPD that Yin is their man. He'll have nowhere else to go. And where he goes, the Syndicate will follow."
// Answer Text :
"P1538067389" "Do you think he'd do that?"
// Page InformationPage5 Text :
"P2166096557" "Doesn't matter what I think he'll do. I can't take that risk if he does.<br><br>Listen, we need Yin's Syndicate or we might not win this war, and it is a war. People are dying, so it's a war.<br><br>Just take down Octavian and inform the PPD. I've got the rest handled."
// Answer Text :
"P2367582398" "Alright, consider it done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OctavianDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P648372293" "I... I underestimated... him."
// Answer Text :
"P2354932827" "Tang offered you the chance to die with honor, why did you refuse?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1535354126" "There was more at stake than my honor. I was fighting for the beliefs that the Syndicate was founded on. The beliefs that were cast aside when Yin threw his lot in with your kind!"
// Answer Text :
"P1199349087" "Yin?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1600523573" "<color orange>Octavian laughs at the unexpected revelation.</color><br><br>So you didn't even know who you were truly working for. Priceless. Well done Master Yin, well done."
// Answer Text :
"P2730322127" "Mr. Yin is the head of the Syndicate!?"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P431920779" "Is it so hard to believe, {HeroName}, that the CEO of Yin Corp, the largest mega corporation in the world is also the head of the world spanning Syndicate crime organization?<br><br>Unfortunately the Syndicate's days are numbered. Now that Yin has won the Syndicate will be torn down in the war between Cole and the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P1450701795" "What are you talking about?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3550028965" "Yin has allied the Syndicate with the Resistance. That's why I aligned myself against Yin."
// Answer Text :
"P2313737660" "Why did Yin ally with the Resistance if it caused so much strife?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P4004364455" "For his daughter."
// Answer Text :
"P190401801" "His daughter? Penelope Yin? What about her?"
// Page Page6 Text :
"P88551215" "She's what started this whole war in the first place. Well, she didn't do it specifically.<br><br>She disappeared, {HeroName}, and when that happened everyone started pointing fingers. Even Yin was convinced that one of us had taken his daughter.<br><br>The other bosses, like myself, knew it was only a matter of time before Yin accused us of the heinous crime, so we split off.<br><br>Then Yin turned to the Resistance for aid, and that changed everything."
// Answer Text :
"P3618278646" "So Penelope is still missing?"
// Page Page7 Text :
"P333147792" "I don't know if she ever actually was, to be honest.<br><br>All I know is that the Syndicate as we built it has been destroyed, and all that remains is the Yin family and his few remaining allies.<br><br>For my part I wish I had kidnapped Ms. Yin... at least then I'd know before I die that she is safe."
// Answer Text :
"P849498858" ""Good bye Octavian." (Finish him!)"
// Page Page8 Text :
"P3905147894" "<color orange>You render Octavian unconscious.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1517400020" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4278331931" "<color orange>Jones wants you to report back to him.</color> He's got orders for you, probably from Tub Ci Tang."
// AcceptString :
"P2634348261" "Report to Jones"
// SendOffString :
"P4029892107" "Everything we've dug up about Tang says that he was the leader of the Tsoo, the asian gang that absorbed the remnants of both the Triad and Yakuza after the Hamidon Wars.<br><br>Tang and the Tsoo were, reportedly, completely obliterated fifteen years ago. All reports said that Tang had died in the fighting, but if he's resurfaced in the Syndicate, then there is no telling how many of his old comrades might have found solace there as well.<br><br>From what you've told me, he appears to have gained immense personal insight from his master. That means his psychic potential was unlocked by the mysterious master of the Syndicate. Whoever his master is, they must be an immensely powerful psychic... and the fact that Praetor Tilman has not discovered them worries me, frankly. I don't know if the Seers will be able to shield you from such a person's attempts to read your mind.<br><br>Be very careful."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2630131143" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: There Can Be Only One.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1935626692" "Jones said it was important."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3884611585" "Master Tang has informed me that you will have the honor of slaying Octavian.<br><br>Tang has offered Octavian a chance to die with honor, but the coward refused, and instead has chosen to sacrifice more of his men by hiding behind them.<color orange> Finish Octavian off yourself, he will not be given the honor to die at the hands of Master Tang.</color><br><br><color Paragon>Members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1813560417" "Restore the Syndicate"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1705919601" "So, Tang is to have you take out Octavian. Be careful, {HeroName}. If they've discovered your true loyalties then they may be trying to kill two birds with one stone here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P523243973" "The Syndicate are ready for you. Octavian is nowhere to be seen."

