"P3345122264" "Octavian is dead, order has been restored and the Syndicate is once more whole again.<br><br>As an outsider to our organization, {HeroName}, you may not be able to fully appreciate what you have done, but Master Tang sends you his heartfelt thanks for the assistance you and the Resistance have provided us thus far.<br><br>Soon it will be time for the Syndicate to repay our debt to you."

