// Dialog :
"P2048494869" "Mr. Wu Yin...<br><br>The CEO of the largest mega corp in the world. A global spanning economic super power. Of course, it all makes perfect sense.<br><br>If Yin plans on uniting the Syndicate with the Resistance then we have very little time to act, {HeroName}. Before Yin can consolidate his strength after this conflict we will have to strike.<br><br>Talk to me when you are ready to move against him."
// RandomFameString :
"P1346376944" "I heard that a major undercover operation is really putting the hurt on the Syndicate."

